\par }\pard \qj\sa120\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar {\b New plan of the plant}
\par \pard \qj\sa120\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar In order to reduce overheads and payments for the inefficient u
se of the site space, space reduction was organised. One of the bays was closed completely and around the site several buildings were closed. Around the plant 25 % of the area was closed.
\par \pard \qj\sa120\widctlpar\box\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp20 \pvpara\posy0\dxfrtext180\dfrmtxtx180\dfrmtxty0 {\b Plan of the plant}{\b\lang1024  }{\lang1024 
