\par \pard \qj\li720\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar {\b\ul capital repair of carriages} : by 50,5%
\par \pard \qj\li720\sa120\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar {\b\ul forming of the new wheel sets} - by 15,9%
\par \pard \qj\sa120\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar The volume of production of the other products of the plant fell because of the lack of the external orders.
